SUMMARY:River Run + Cold Plunge (with Sauna!)
DESCRIPTION:Trade your Saturday afternoon for a tidal adventure on the Petaluma River. Launching from downtown Petaluma\, this guided Downriver Run takes you six scenic miles through wide-open wetlands and peaceful river landscapes in easy-to-use Hobie pedal kayaks. \nFrom 3–5 pm\, ride the outgoing tide from The Floathouse Petaluma to Lakeville Landing Marina\, where the experience can continue with an optional discounted sauna + cold plunge session at Sundrop Sauna from 5–6:30 pm. Warm up in the sauna\, cool down with a plunge\, and relax riverside in the golden evening light. \nWant to make it a floating picnic party? Add a Bella Box from La Bella Charcuterie\, with omnivore\, vegetarian\, and vegan options available. \nThis is Sonoma County river culture at its finest: movement\, nature\, community\, wellness\, and good vibes — all in one unforgettable afternoon. \nHosted by The Floathouse Petaluma\, Sonoma County’s go-to for getting out on the Petaluma River with kayaks\, paddle boards\, water bikes\, guided experiences\, and more. We know how to get you into the community.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/river-run-cold-plunge-with-sauna/
LOCATION:The Floathouse Petaluma\, 50 Water Street\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Recreation
END:VEVENT
