SUMMARY:Healdsburg Crush
DESCRIPTION:Raise a glass for a great cause at Healdsburg Crush\, moving to a new iconic location\, Bacchus Landing\, on Sunday\, October 11\, 2026. Enjoy a rare chance to sip world-class wines all in one place at one of Sonoma County’s most beloved gathering spots. \nSample Pinot Noir\, Chardonnay\, and Sparkling Wines from 60+ of California’s top producers\, all in an open-air\, walk-around format that celebrates the best of wine country. \nEnjoy VIP early access from 12–1pm\, followed by General Admission from 1–4pm. \nPresented by and benefiting Boys & Girls Clubs of Sonoma-Marin\, Healdsburg Crush supports life-changing programs for over 11\,000 youth across the region. 100% of net proceeds go directly to these programs. \nTickets and full details at healdsburgcrush.com. 21+ only. No children\, strollers\, or pets permitted.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/healdsburg-crush/
LOCATION:Bacchus Landing\, 14210 Bacchus Landing Way\, Healdsburg\, CA\, 95448
CATEGORIES:Festival,Other
END:VEVENT
