SUMMARY:Crooner Ed Live at Andrews Hall
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a wonderful evening of easy listening jazz\, timeless standards\, romance and irresistible charm with the Bay Area’s own chart topping Crooner Ed. His entire show is backed by wonderful cinematic movies on a giant screen. It’s a great night of music and charm you won’t want to miss.
