SUMMARY:Día de los Muertos / Fiesta 2026
DESCRIPTION:In the spirit of celebration\, bring pictures of your dearly departed to place on our communal altar (we’ll provide the frames). Music and activities will surround our plaza\, bringing a sense of a Mexican pueblo. Authentic Mexican food stations paired with Keller Estate wines will create the perfect backdrop for a truly festive evening.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/dia-de-los-muertos-fiesta-2026/
LOCATION:Keller Estate Winery\, 5875 Lakeville Highway\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Recreation
END:VEVENT
